    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Going on foot or by vehicle",
     "texto": [
      "**Idę** means «I go on foot»; **jadę**, «I travel by vehicle».",
      "If we say how we travel, the vehicle usually takes the instrumental: **autobusem**, **tramwajem**, **pociągiem**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Destination",
     "texto": [
      "To travel to a city, use **do** with the noun in the genitive: **do Warszawy**, «to Warsaw».",
      "**Na dworzec** is a destination expression that is best learnt as a whole."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
